rgy — Notices
=============

Lineage
-------
rgy merges three prior projects into one workspace:

- `fsearch` (Rust) — name indexing, fuzzy ranking, and the query engine in
  `crates/name-core`. Three of its files (`name_index`, `name_query` and
  `content`) keep fsearch's MIT terms, and the notice travels with them in
  `LICENSE-MIT-FSEARCH`; the rest of the crate is Apache-2.0.
- the `zen` project (this workspace's `zen-rs`, `search-ui`, and
  `discovery-windows`) - Windows NTFS discovery and the terminal UI.
  Apache-2.0 only here; see COPYING.
- `rgx` — the content-search engine, the adapters and the Tesla Valve pack
  store in `crates/rgx-*` and `crates/rar-codec`. Apache-2.0, as upstream
  offers it and as this workspace transports it verbatim; see COPYING.

Ideas, protocols, and behavioral parity (query syntax, rg-compatible
flags, on-disk format layouts) are not code and are not subject to
copyright. Named projects are referenced nominatively; no affiliation is
implied.

